/* zh-SG translations for "ch2" (generated by tools/i18n-pack.js; keys are the English source). */
Object.assign(window.I18N['zh-SG'].text, {
  "Chapter 2": "第二章",
  "The Group Date": "集体出游",
  "Chapter 3 — Seen at 2:14 AM": "第三章 · 凌晨2:14已读",
  "Bro. BRO. I organised a group outing. Saturday, Sentosa. Five girls said yes.": "兄弟。兄弟！我约了一个集体出游。礼拜六，圣淘沙。五个女生说好。",
  "Five?": "五个？",
  "Two said yes. Three said \"see how\". Which is basically yes.": "两个说好，三个说“再看看”。那就是好啦。",
  "Tip: be curious, not impressive. Nobody falls for a résumé.": "提示：好奇比耍帅有用。没有人会爱上一份简历。",
  "Saturday, Mount Faber. The cable car queue is forty minutes and has no shade. You end up next to Xin Yi.": "礼拜六，花柏山。缆车要排四十分钟，一点遮阴都没有。你刚好排在欣怡旁边。",
  "Forty minutes. What do you talk about?": "四十分钟。聊什么好？",
  "\"Eh, did you finish the Starlight Postman one? With the hundred-year letter?\"": "“诶，《星光邮差》那本你看完了吗？那封一百年的信？”",
  "You remembered! Volume 3 is where the postman— no wait, I won't spoil. Did you start?": "你记得哦！第三集那个邮差他——不行，不能剧透。你开始看了吗？",
  "Chapter two. Why does he keep the letters he can't deliver?": "看到第二章。他为什么要留着那些送不出去的信？",
  "That's... exactly the right question. Okay. So.": "这个……问得刚刚好。好，你听我说。",
  "The forty minutes feel like four.": "四十分钟，感觉只过了四分钟。",
  "\"What else do you read? Not just fantasy, right?\" (Then actually follow up.)": "“你除了奇幻还看什么？”（然后真的接着问下去）",
  "Um. Old Singapore ghost stories? My ah ma used to tell them. I'm trying to write them down.": "嗯……新加坡的老鬼故事？我阿嫲以前常讲。我在试着把它们写下来。",
  "Wait, you write? Okay, what's the scariest one?": "等等，你会写东西？那最恐怖的是哪个？",
  "...The pontianak at the banana tree near her kampung. Okay. This one takes a while.": "……她甘榜旁边香蕉树下的女鬼。好，这个要讲很久哦。",
  "Explain your mobile game rank. In detail. For forty minutes.": "跟她讲你手游的段位。很详细地讲。讲四十分钟。",
  "Minute twenty: Xin Yi's eyes have gone glassy. Minute thirty-five: the uncle behind you is asleep standing up.": "第二十分钟，欣怡眼神放空了。第三十五分钟，后面那个安哥站着睡着了。",
  "Conversation is catch, rookie. You just threw forty balls into the sea.": "聊天是传接球，菜鸟。你刚把四十颗球全丢进海里了。",
  "(Stay on your phone.)": "（继续滑手机）",
  "She reads. You scroll. The queue moves. That's all.": "她看书，你滑手机，队伍往前挪。就这样。",
  "In the cable car, an ad autoplays on your phone. You forgot it was on loudspeaker.": "缆车上，手机自动播起一个广告。你忘了开着外放。",
  "Alpha Kai 💪": "阿尔法·凯 💪",
  "ALPHA TIP #7: NEG her to lower her value. Try: \"You'd be cute if you smiled more.\" Works every time. Link in bio. 🔥": "阿尔法秘诀#7：先贬低她，降低她的身价。试试：“你多笑一点会比较可爱。”百试百灵。链接在简介。🔥",
  "Kavya pretends she didn't hear. She's looking out at the sea, calves still taped from this morning's time trial.": "卡维娅装作没听到，看着窗外的海。小腿上还贴着早上计时赛的肌贴。",
  "Say something to Kavya...": "跟卡维娅说点什么……",
  "\"Your 100m start this morning was crazy. How do you get out of the blocks that fast?\"": "“你今早一百米那个起跑太猛了吧。怎么能冲那么快？”",
  "You saw? ...It's the first three steps. Everyone thinks it's legs. It's arms.": "你有看？……关键是前三步。大家都以为靠腿，其实是靠手臂。",
  "I'll show you one day. You'll be slow, but I'll show you.": "改天教你。你会很慢，不过我教你。",
  "\"You'd be cute if you smiled more.\"": "“你多笑一点会比较可爱。”",
  "Wow. You got that from the guy who rents a Lamborghini for his videos, right?": "哇。跟那个租兰博基尼拍视频的人学的吧？",
  "She laughs. At you. Across the cabin, Haziq facepalms so hard the cable car sways.": "她笑了。是在笑你。对面的哈齐克拍额头拍得整个缆车都晃了。",
  "(Deep voice.) \"I'm the prize here. You should be impressing me.\"": "（压低嗓音）“我才是奖品。应该是你来讨好我。”",
  "At the next station, everyone else in the cabin gets off. You ride to Sentosa alone. With your deep voice.": "到了下一站，缆车里其他人全下车了。你一个人坐到圣淘沙。带着你的低音。",
  "BAD END #4 — Negged Yourself": "坏结局 #4 · 贬低到自己头上",
  "You tried to make her feel small so you'd feel big. Now you're very alone in a very big cable car. Confidence doesn't need anyone to shrink.": "你想让她觉得自己渺小，好显得你高大。结果你一个人坐在很大的缆车里。真正的自信，不需要别人变小。",
  "Beach Station, a dessert kiosk. Mango bingsu, $18 for the \"premium\". Your pocket money for the whole month is about $100.": "海滩站旁边的甜品亭。芒果雪花冰，“豪华版”一碗$18。你一个月的零用钱大概才$100。",
  "You kind of want to look generous...": "你有点想显得大方……",
  "\"Two big ones, we share? I'll get this, you all belanja drinks later.\"": "“买两碗大的一起吃？这轮我请，等下饮料你们请。”",
  "Share better lah. Then everybody gets mango.": "一起吃比较好啦。这样每个人都吃得到芒果。",
  "Buy everyone a premium one. All six. $108.": "每人一碗豪华版。六碗。$108。",
  "Omg thank you!! Wait wait, don't eat yet— photo first.": "天啊谢谢！！等一下等一下先别吃——先拍照。",
  "She posts it. She doesn't eat it. It melts.": "她发了动态。她没吃。冰化了。",
  "They liked the bingsu. Different thing. Also, you're broke till April.": "她们喜欢的是雪花冰，不是同一回事。还有，你到四月都要吃土了。",
  "\"Haziq, you organised this. You pay.\"": "“哈齐克，是你约的，你请。”",
  "...Bro. I have eleven dollars. And my ez-link is in the negative.": "……兄弟。我只有十一块。我的易通卡还是负数的。",
  "Too hot outside, so everyone ends up in the arcade. There's a VR horror ride for two. Elise grabs your arm and points her phone at you both.": "外面太热，大家最后都躲进了游乐中心。里面有个双人VR鬼屋。爱丽丝一把挽住你的手，手机镜头对准你们俩。",
  "Say something scared for my story! Pretend you're protecting me~": "说点害怕的话给我拍限时动态！假装你在保护我～",
  "Hanis is by the claw machine, a token in her hand. Watching. Not saying anything.": "哈妮丝站在夹娃娃机旁边，手里捏着一个代币。看着。没说话。",
  "What do you do?": "你怎么做？",
  "\"Can. Hanis, come, we do three people. Triple the screaming.\"": "“可以啊。哈妮丝，来，三个人一起。尖叫三倍。”",
  "Fine. But if I scream, you didn't hear anything.": "好啦。但我要是尖叫，你们什么都没听到。",
  "Group shot! Okay, this is actually cuter.": "合照！好啦，这样其实更可爱。",
  "Play it up. Glance at Hanis to make sure she's watching.": "演得很投入。顺便瞄一眼哈妮丝，确认她有在看。",
  "...I'm going to buy bubble tea.": "……我去买珍奶。",
  "Two girls, zero of them asked to be your props.": "两个女生，没有一个答应过当你的道具。",
  "The ride starts. You scream and run out of the booth.": "VR一开始，你尖叫着冲出了机器。",
  "Elise's story hits 4,000 views. Caption: \"my brave protector 💀\". You're famous now. Kind of.": "爱丽丝的限时动态有四千人看。配文：“我勇敢的保护者💀”。你红了。算是吧。",
  "Siloso Beach. Haziq tries a \"cool\" move on the rope swing and goes face-first into the sea. Everyone laughs.": "西乐索海滩。哈齐克在绳索秋千上耍帅，结果脸朝下栽进海里。大家都笑了。",
  "Haziq crawls out, dripping, ears red...": "哈齐克湿淋淋地爬上来，耳朵通红……",
  "Pull him up, throw him your towel, laugh with him: \"Ten out of ten for commitment, bro.\"": "把他拉起来，丢毛巾给他，跟他一起笑：“投入度满分，兄弟。”",
  "Bro... you're a real one. I had a whole plan. The plan was bad.": "兄弟……你够义气。我本来有个计划的。那个计划很烂。",
  "\"This is why you're single, bro.\" Wait for the laugh.": "“难怪你单身啦兄弟。”然后等大家笑。",
  "A few people laugh. Hanis doesn't. Haziq laughs too, one beat late, then goes quiet for the rest of the day.": "有几个人笑了，哈妮丝没有。哈齐克也跟着笑，慢了半拍。之后一整天他都没怎么说话。",
  "Ava tagged along. Hanis invited her in the class chat and she said yes in four seconds. She's soaked, sandy and holding three people's slippers.": "艾娃也跟来了。哈妮丝在班级群里邀她，她四秒就说好。她全身湿透、满脚沙，手里还拎着三个人的拖鞋。",
  "Can I hug you? I'm a hugger. You don't have to be. High fives are also elite.": "我可以抱你一下吗？我是爱抱抱的人。你不用也是。击掌也超棒。",
  "She waits, arms half out, not moving until you answer.": "她张着半开的手臂等着，你没回答之前她一动不动。",
  "\"Sure, come.\"": "“可以啊，来。”",
  "A quick, sandy hug. She steps back right after.": "一个很快、沾满沙的拥抱。她马上退开一步。",
  "Thank you! Okay. Friendship officially sandy.": "谢啦！好，友谊正式沾上沙了。",
  "\"Not really a hugger. High five?\"": "“我不太习惯抱。击掌？”",
  "Elite choice. Up top!": "好选择。来，举高！",
  "The high five is so loud that Haziq looks over.": "击掌声大到哈齐克都转过头来。",
  "\"Maybe later. Not now.\"": "“等下吧。现在不要。”",
  "Totally fair. Offer stands. No expiry date.": "完全OK。邀请一直有效，没有期限。",
  "Three answers, three right ones. She asked, and she meant the question.": "三种回答，三种都对。她问了，而且是真心在问。",
  "Lunch on the sand. Haziq opens his mum's tupperware: sambal goreng, tempeh and long beans.": "沙滩上吃午餐。哈齐克打开他妈妈的保鲜盒：sambal goreng，炸豆饼配长豆。",
  "Oh, that's kinda weird. Beans with... is that peanut? And chilli?": "噢，这有点怪耶。豆子配……那是花生？还有辣椒？",
  "...It's my mum's.": "……这是我妈煮的。",
  "She called Haziq's mum's sambal goreng \"kinda weird\".": "她说哈齐克妈妈煮的 sambal goreng“有点怪”。",
  "Haziq goes quiet. Ava hasn't noticed yet.": "哈齐克安静了下来。艾娃还没察觉。",
  "\"It's sambal goreng. His mum makes it every Raya. Try one bite before you decide?\"": "“这是 sambal goreng。他妈妈每年开斋节都煮。先吃一口再决定？”",
  "Oh no. I said that out loud. Haziq, I'm sorry. Can I try some? Please?": "噢不。我居然说出口了。哈齐克，对不起。我可以吃一点吗？拜托？",
  "She tries it. Her eyes go wide. She asks for the recipe, then asks whether his mum would mind her asking for the recipe.": "她尝了一口，眼睛瞪得好大。她问能不能要食谱，接着又问，问他妈妈要食谱会不会太冒昧。",
  "Okay, okay. Forgiven. Ten out of ten for commitment.": "好啦好啦，原谅你。态度满分。",
  "Laugh along. \"Haha, ya, bit weird.\"": "跟着笑：“哈哈，对啊，有点怪。”",
  "Haziq closes the box. He eats it later, alone, on the bus.": "哈齐克把盒子盖上。后来他在巴士上一个人吃完了。",
  "'Weird' about someone's mum's cooking is never small. She didn't have the context. You did.": "说别人妈妈煮的菜“怪”，从来不是小事。她不懂背景，你懂。",
  "Sunset. Everyone's sandy and tired, sharing one packet of keropok. Elise is filming the sky. Somebody asks how many close friends you each have.": "日落了。大家满身是沙，累得不想动，分着吃一包虾饼。爱丽丝在拍天空。有人问：你们每个人有几个真正的好朋友？",
  "{n:yuna} has four hundred \"besties\". {n:mio} has one. What makes a good friend, to you?": "{n:yuna}有四百个“闺蜜”。{n:mio}只有一个。你觉得怎样才算好朋友？",
  "\"Depends on the person, I think. What does one close friend give you that a crowd can't?\"": "“我觉得看人。一个很好的朋友，能给你什么是一大群人给不了的？”",
  "And your own view?": "那你自己的看法呢？",
  "\"A few deep friends. People who'd come at 3 AM.\"": "“几个很铁的。凌晨三点叫得出来的那种。”",
  "\"A few close ones, plus a bigger, lighter circle.\"": "“几个很好的，再加一圈普通朋友。”",
  "\"The more the better. Everyone has something to teach you.\"": "“越多越好。每个人都有东西可以教你。”",
  "\"One friend only? That's a bit sad leh.\"": "“只有一个朋友？有点可怜咧。”",
  "Nobody wants to go home yet, so: KTV at VivoCity. Haziq is murdering a Jay Chou song. Your phone buzzes.": "没人想回家，于是去了怡丰城唱K。哈齐克正在谋杀一首周杰伦。你的手机震了。",
  "ur friends are so boring, they don't get u like i do 🥺": "你那些朋友好无聊哦，他们才不像我这么懂你🥺",
  "hiii it's Rae from the walkway 🌙 ur friends are so boring, they don't get u like i do 🥺": "嗨～我是走廊那个瑞儿🌙 你那些朋友好无聊哦，他们才不像我这么懂你🥺",
  "skip school monday and come see me? just u and me ✨": "礼拜一不要去学校，来找我好不好？只有你和我✨",
  "Rae wants you away from your friends...": "瑞儿要你离开你的朋友……",
  "\"Having fun with my friends! Bye 😅\" Phone in pocket. Grab the mic.": "“我跟朋友玩得很开心！拜拜😅”手机收进口袋，抢过麦克风。",
  "You and Haziq duet \"Shape of You\". It's terrible. It's perfect.": "你和哈齐克合唱《Shape of You》。难听死了。完美。",
  "Leave KTV early to go meet her.": "提早离开KTV去找她。",
  "You wait at HarbourFront MRT for an hour. She never comes. Then: \"next time 😘\". Your friends finish the night without you.": "你在港湾地铁站等了一个钟头。她没出现。然后传来一句：“下次啦😘”。你的朋友们没有你，照样唱到散场。",
  "First she wanted you alone. Remember that part.": "她第一步，是要你一个人。记住这一点。",
  "Skip school on Monday. She asks for your bank PIN \"for our future\". You give it.": "礼拜一翘课去找她。她说“为了我们的未来”要你的银行密码。你给了。",
  "Tuesday, 6 AM. Your bank app: $0.00. Three transfers to accounts you've never heard of. Rae's number is not in service.": "礼拜二早上六点。银行app显示：$0.00。三笔转账，转去你从没听过的户口。瑞儿的号码已经停用。",
  "BAD END #5 — Just You and Me": "坏结局 #5 · 只有你和我",
  "First: \"your friends don't get you.\" Then: \"just you and me.\" Then: your PIN. Almost every scam starts by getting you alone. Your friends are your alarm system.": "先是“你朋友不懂你”，再来“只有你和我”，最后是你的密码。几乎每一个骗局，第一步都是让你落单。朋友就是你的警报器。",
  "Walking home from the MRT, legs aching, a bit sunburnt. Mochi opens a new panel on your phone: four bars called Your Life.": "从地铁站走回家，脚好酸，脸有点晒伤。麻糬在你手机上打开一个新页面：四条叫“你的生活”的进度条。",
  "Pick something that's yours. Not to impress anyone. Something you'd do even if nobody ever saw.": "选一样属于你自己的东西。不是为了让谁欣赏。就算没人看见，你也会去做的那种。",
  "Your passion:": "你的热爱：",
  "Guitar. The secondhand one under your bed.": "吉他。床底那把二手的。",
  "Guitar. One hour a week, minimum. I'll be listening. Please learn more than three chords.": "吉他。每周至少一小时。我会听着的。拜托学多过三个和弦。",
  "Drawing. The sketchbook full of void decks.": "画画。那本画满组屋楼下的速写本。",
  "Drawing. One hour a week. Start with hands. Everyone hates hands.": "画画。每周一小时。先练手。大家都讨厌画手。",
  "Coding a small game. You've got half a platformer.": "写个小游戏。你已经做了半个跳跃游戏。",
  "A game! Put a cat in it. Not a request.": "游戏！里面要有猫。这不是请求。",
  "Basketball. The court at Block 412.": "篮球。412座楼下那个球场。",
  "Basketball. Haziq will cry happy tears. Practise free throws, not dunks.": "篮球。哈齐克会感动到哭。先练罚球，不要练灌篮。",
  "All four. Why choose?": "四样都要。干嘛要选？",
  "All four at half speed. Ambitious. We'll see.": "四样都做一半。很有野心。走着瞧。",
  "\"My passion is... her.\"": "“我的热爱是……她。”",
  "That's a person, not a hobby. Fine, I'm signing you up for all four. Pick one later.": "那是一个人，不是兴趣。算了，四样都帮你报名。以后再挑一个。",
  "Eh. You were... different today. Nicer.": "诶。你今天……有点不一样。比较好。",
  "She says it at the lift lobby, not looking at you, and goes in before you can answer.": "她在电梯口说完这句，没看你，你还没回话她就进去了。",
  "\"Nicer.\" From Hanis, that's basically a medal. Now sleep. Your Health bar is judging you.": "“比较好。”从哈妮丝嘴里说出来，等于颁奖了。好了快睡。你的健康条在瞪你。"
});
